{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new responsive Shopify Online Store 2.0 header for SBL Farms based on the reference image.
    
    Keep the SBL Farms logo on the left, navigation in the center, and Search, Login/Account, Wishlist, and Cart on the right. Remove Home.
    
    Navigation:
    Plants ▼ | Seeds ▼ | Pots ▼ | Services ▼ | Gifting ▼ | Blog | Contact
    
    Create 10 fully EDITABLE submenu items for EACH dropdown. Every item must have an editable label, URL, and enable/disable option in Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Plants:
    Indoor Plants, Outdoor Plants, Flowering Plants, Succulents, Cacti, Fruit Plants, Herbs, Air-Purifying Plants, Bonsai Plants, Climbers and Creepers.
    
    Seeds:
    Vegetable Seeds, Flower Seeds, Herb Seeds, Fruit Seeds, Organic Seeds, Microgreen Seeds, Hybrid Seeds, Flower Mix Seeds, Lawn Grass Seeds, Seasonal Seeds.
    
    Pots:
    Terracotta Pots, Ceramic Pots, Plastic Pots, Hanging Planters, Self-Watering Pots, Grow Bags, Window Planters, Decorative Planters, Seedling Trays, Plant Stands.
    
    Services:
    Landscaping, Green Walls, AMC (Annual Maintenance Contract), Plant Rental, Indoor Plant Maintenance, Outdoor Plant Maintenance, Garden Maintenance, Terrace Gardening, Vertical Garden Installation, Plant Consultation.
    
    Gifting:
    Corporate Gifting, Bulk Gifting, Plant Gifting, Personalized Plant Gifts, Employee Gifting, Client Gifting, Festive Plant Gifting, Wedding Plant Gifting, Eco-Friendly Gifts, Custom Gift Hampers.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    - All 10 items in every dropdown must display and be editable.
    - Do not show only 4 Services or 2 Gifting items.
    - Do not hard-code submenu items.
    - Every submenu item must have its own clickable Shopify link.
    - Each dropdown must open directly below its own parent menu item.
    - Use cream/off-white background, dark green text, subtle shadow, and clean spacing.
    
    HEADER SETTINGS:
    Make these editable in Theme Editor:
    - Desktop/tablet/mobile header height
    - Logo and logo size
    - Navigation spacing
    - Dropdown width
    - Dropdown item height
    - Font size
    - Header colors
    - Dropdown colors
    - Search width
    - Icon size
    - Header padding
    - Border and shadow
    - Mobile sidebar width
    
    DESKTOP:
    Logo → Navigation → Search → Account → Wishlist → Cart.
    
    MOBILE:
    Create a premium mobile-first header:
    Logo on the left → Search icon → Cart icon → Hamburger icon.
    
    When hamburger is clicked, open a smooth full-height sidebar/drawer.
    
    Mobile sidebar:
    - SBL Farms logo
    - Close button
    - Search
    - Plants ▼
    - Seeds ▼
    - Pots ▼
    - Services ▼
    - Gifting ▼
    - Blog
    - Contact
    - Account
    - Wishlist
    - Cart
    
    All dropdowns inside the mobile sidebar must work as smooth accordion menus and show all 10 submenu items.
    
    MOBILE RESPONSIVENESS:
    - Optimize specifically for phones from 320px to 767px.
    - No horizontal scrolling.
    - No overlapping text or icons.
    - No clipped dropdowns.
    - Proper touch-friendly spacing.
    - Minimum 44px tap area for buttons/icons.
    - Sidebar should fit perfectly within the screen.
    - Lock background scrolling while sidebar is open.
    - Add a smooth overlay behind the sidebar.
    - Close sidebar when the overlay or close button is clicked.
    - Keep submenu text readable and properly aligned.
    - Automatically adapt spacing and font sizes for smaller screens.
    - Ensure the header remains compact without hiding important controls.
    
    Use Shopify's native Search, Customer Account, and Cart functionality. Make the wishlist URL editable.
    
    Make the complete header polished, lightweight, accessible, and fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.header_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.header_text }};box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(13,58,29,.1)}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bar{min-height:{{ block.settings.mobile_height }}px;padding:0 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo img{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.logo_width }}px;max-height:70px;object-fit:contain}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav,.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desktop-actions{display:none}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls{display:flex;align-items:center}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }} button,.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls a{min-width:44px;min-height:44px;border:0;background:none;color:inherit;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg{width:{{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.icon_size }}px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer{position:fixed;z-index:91;top:0;right:0;width:min({{ block.settings.sidebar_width }}px,88vw);height:100dvh;background:{{ block.settings.dropdown_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.dropdown_text }};transform:translateX(105%);transition:transform .25s;overflow:auto;padding:16px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}.open .sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer{transform:translateX(0)}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__overlay{display:block;position:fixed;z-index:90;inset:0;background:#0008;opacity:0;visibility:hidden}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}.open .sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__overlay{opacity:1;visibility:visible}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group{border-bottom:1px solid #d8dfd3}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle,.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link{display:flex;width:100%;min-height:48px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;background:none;border:0;text-align:left;font-size:16px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub{display:none;padding-left:12px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group.expanded .sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub{display:block}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub a{display:flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center;padding:8px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-search{display:flex;border:1px solid #d8dfd3;border-radius:24px;margin:12px 0}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-search input{min-width:0;flex:1;padding:12px;border:0;background:none}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-search button{min-width:44px}@media(min-width:768px){.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bar{min-height:{{ block.settings.desktop_height }}px;padding:0 {{ block.settings.header_padding }}px;gap:20px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{display:flex;flex:1;justify-content:center}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav ul{display:flex;gap:{{ block.settings.nav_spacing }}px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav li{position:relative}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:{{ block.settings.font_size }}px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;width:{{ block.settings.dropdown_width }}px;background:{{ block.settings.dropdown_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.dropdown_text }};box-shadow:0 8px 24px #0002;padding:8px;z-index:4}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav li:hover .sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown,.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav li:focus-within .sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{display:block}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown a{min-height:{{ block.settings.dropdown_item_height }}px;padding:8px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desktop-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search{width:{{ block.settings.search_width }}px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search input{width:75%;padding:10px}.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls,.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer,.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__overlay{display:none!important}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{transition:none!important}}
{% endstyle %}
<sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bar"><a class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{% if block.settings.logo %}<img src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.logo.alt | default: 'SBL Farms' | escape }}">{% else %}<strong>SBL Farms</strong>{% endif %}</a><nav class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><ul>{% assign groups='plants,seeds,pots,services,gifting'|split:',' %}{% for group in groups %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings[group] | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ group | capitalize }} ▼</a><div class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown">{% for i in (1..10) %}{% assign ek=group|append:'_item_'|append:i|append:'_enabled' %}{% assign lk=group|append:'_item_'|append:i|append:'_label' %}{% assign uk=group|append:'_item_'|append:i|append:'_url' %}{% if block.settings[ek] %}<a href="{{ block.settings[uk] | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ block.settings[lk] }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></li>{% endfor %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.blog_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Blog</a></li><li><a href="{{ block.settings.contact_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Contact</a></li></ul></nav><div class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desktop-actions"><form class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get"><input name="q" type="search" aria-label="Search" placeholder="Search"><button aria-label="Search">⌕</button></form><a href="{{ routes.account_url }}" aria-label="Account">Account</a><a href="{{ block.settings.wishlist_url | default: routes.root_url }}" aria-label="Wishlist">♡</a><a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="Cart">Cart</a></div><div class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls"><a href="{{ routes.search_url }}" aria-label="Search">⌕</a><a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="Cart">♧</a><button type="button" class="openbtn" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button></div></div><button class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__overlay" aria-label="Close menu"></button><aside class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer" aria-hidden="true"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><strong>SBL Farms</strong><button class="closebtn" aria-label="Close menu">×</button></div><form class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-search" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get"><input type="search" name="q" placeholder="Search products" aria-label="Search products"><button aria-label="Submit search">⌕</button></form>{% for group in groups %}<div class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__group"><button class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle" aria-expanded="false">{{ group | capitalize }} <span>⌄</span></button><div class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub">{% for i in (1..10) %}{% assign ek=group|append:'_item_'|append:i|append:'_enabled' %}{% assign lk=group|append:'_item_'|append:i|append:'_label' %}{% assign uk=group|append:'_item_'|append:i|append:'_url' %}{% if block.settings[ek] %}<a href="{{ block.settings[uk] | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ block.settings[lk] }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div>{% endfor %}<a class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.blog_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Blog</a><a class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.contact_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Contact</a><a class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ routes.account_url }}">Account</a><a class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.wishlist_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Wishlist</a><a class="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Cart</a></aside></sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const tag='sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;customElements.define(tag,class extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){const drawer=this.querySelector('.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer'),trigger=this.querySelector('.openbtn'),close=this.querySelector('.closebtn'),overlay=this.querySelector('.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__overlay');const shut=()=>{this.classList.remove('open');drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');document.body.style.overflow=''};trigger.addEventListener('click',()=>{this.classList.add('open');drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');document.body.style.overflow='hidden'});close.addEventListener('click',shut);overlay.addEventListener('click',shut);this.querySelectorAll('.sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const g=b.parentElement;g.classList.toggle('expanded');b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',g.classList.contains('expanded'))}));this.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')shut()})}})})();</script>
